sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant IPP as IPP ExternalProcessor<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as llm-d Router (EPP)
    participant ModelSrv as Model Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 1: Inference Request Processing

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (API key)<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS 1.2+
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc RequestHeaders<br/>gRPC/9004 (Optional TLS)
    IPP->>IPP: PreProcessors execute
    IPP->>IPP: ProfilePicker selects profile
    IPP->>IPP: Request Plugins execute
    IPP-->>Envoy: HeaderMutation (add routing headers)

    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc RequestBody
    IPP->>IPP: Extract model name from body
    IPP->>K8sAPI: Lookup base model mapping<br/>(cached ConfigMap watch)
    K8sAPI-->>IPP: ConfigMap data
    IPP->>IPP: ModelSelector: Filter → Score → Pick
    IPP-->>Envoy: HeaderMutation<br/>(X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name)

    Note over Envoy: HTTPRoute matches<br/>on injected header

    Envoy->>EPP: Route to correct InferencePool
    EPP->>EPP: Select optimal pod
    Envoy->>ModelSrv: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000

    ModelSrv-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc ResponseHeaders
    IPP->>IPP: Response Plugins execute
    IPP->>IPP: PostProcessors execute
    IPP-->>Envoy: Response mutations
    Envoy-->>Client: JSON response

    Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 2: Multi-Pool Routing Detail

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>model: "llama-lora-adapter-1"
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc callout
    IPP->>IPP: Extract model from body<br/>Lookup base model in cache<br/>llama-lora-adapter-1 → llama-3-base
    IPP-->>Envoy: Inject header<br/>X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name: llama-3-base
    Note over Envoy: HTTPRoute rule matches<br/>header → InferencePool-A
    Envoy->>ModelSrv: Route to Pool-A<br/>(EPP selects pod)
    ModelSrv-->>Envoy: Response
    Envoy-->>Client: Response
